  "html": "<div id=\"BUV\" class=\"uplift front\">\n    <section id=\"course-front-body\" class=\"responsive-padding\" style=\"color: #2d3b45; background: none; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px;\">\n        <article id=\"course-lesson-intro-text\" style=\"font-size: 1.2em;\">\n            <h3 class=\"heavy\" style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 2.7em;\">Statistics 2 ST104B</h3>\n            <p>The course provides a precise and accurate treatment of probability, distribution theory and statistical inference at the introductory level.</p>\n        </article>\n        <div class=\"grid-row\">\n            <article class=\"col-lg-4\" style=\"padding-left: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-top: 20px;\">\n                <p class=\"buv-responsive-video\"><iframe class=\"lti-embed\" style=\"display: inline-block;\" title=\"Introduction_ST104B\" src=\"https://buv.instructure.com/courses/7014/external_tools/retrieve?display=borderless&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fbuv.instructuremedia.com%2Flti%2Flaunch%3Fcustom_arc_launch_type%3Dlearn_embed%26custom_arc_media_id%3Df9f2cfdc-6f2f-451c-9552-273bdd632374-34853%26custom_arc_start_at%3D0\" loading=\"lazy\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" webkitallowfullscreen=\"webkitallowfullscreen\" mozallowfullscreen=\"mozallowfullscreen\" allow=\"geolocation *; microphone *; camera *; midi *; encrypted-media *; autoplay *; clipboard-write *; display-capture *; fullscreen *\" data-titletext=\"Introduction_ST104B\" data-studio-resizable=\"true\" data-studio-tray-enabled=\"true\" data-studio-convertible-to-link=\"true\"></iframe></p>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"col-lg-8\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; padding-left: 12px;\">\n                <h3 style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3;\"><strong>Aims and objectives:</strong></h3>\n                <p style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 0 0 11px 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5;\">+ To develop students' knowledge of elementary statistical theory.</p>\n                <p style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 0 0 11px 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5;\">+ To develop knowledge of topics that are of importance in applications to econometrics, finance and the social sciences.</p>\n                <p style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 0 0 11px 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5;\">+ To introduce concepts and methods that provide the foundation for more specialised courses in statistics.</p>\n            </article>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid-row responsive-padding\" style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; margin-bottom: -50px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"padding-left: 12px;\"><strong>Module Content:</strong></h3>\n</div>"
